{"repositoryId":1234490324,"availability":"available","full":"carlosdmv7/spanish-housing-radar","name":"spanish-housing-radar","description":"End-to-end analytics engineering pipeline: scrapes Spanish housing listings, models them with dbt on MotherDuck, and scores under-priced homes in a live Streamlit app","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-10T08:50:46Z","updated":"2026-10-12T05:53:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://spanish-housing-radar-carlosdmv7.streamlit.app/","topics":["analytics-engineering","data-engineering","data-pipeline","dbt","duckdb","motherduck","prefect","python","streamlit","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://spanish-housing-radar-carlosdmv7.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.082Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.082Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.082Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.082Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Is this flat expensive? No portal will tell you. This does.","Spanish property portals show you a price. They never show you whether it is a good price. \"€225,000 for 120 m² in Patraix\" is a number with nothing to compare it against — and the only answer that means anything is what are the other flats in Patraix asking per square metre? No portal shows you that, because no portal is in the business of telling you a flat is overpriced.","Spanish Housing Radar builds that comparison and scores every flat 0–100 against its own neighbourhood — so the question stops being \"can I afford this?\" and becomes \"is this a deal?\""],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/carlosdmv7/spanish-housing-radar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"076cc63b20181017e87ae09daf7a76f69ce44e99ca1cfb6b771bca65545598eb","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.174Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:35.174Z","projectInsights":{"version":1